<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Data Centers</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Precision EMS for AI data center infrastructure</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures control electronics and modules used around thermoelectric cooling devices, together with high-density PCBAs for optical test equipment and SiC power-conversion assemblies for data-center infrastructure.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Our scope</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-data-centers-hero.webp" alt="Data centre cooling and power infrastructure hardware" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Thermoelectric coolers (TEC)</span><span>Optical transceiver test systems</span><span>SiC power conversion</span><span>High density PCBA</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why AI-infrastructure buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Precision electronics for thermal, optical and power systems</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">AI data-center infrastructure combines demanding thermal-management, signal-integrity and power-conversion requirements. Hana supports these applications through high-density SMT, module assembly, microelectronics and in-house automation engineering.</p><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Thermoelectric cooling programs use control, power-management and current-regulation electronics around TEC devices and integrated cooling modules. Optical test equipment requires dense, multi-layer PCBAs with controlled reflow and inspection of hidden solder joints. SiC power-conversion programs draw on Hana's experience in power-device assembly and high-current interconnect.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Combined PCBA + OSAT within one group</div><p>Board assembly and semiconductor packaging capabilities are available within the Hana manufacturing group, supporting programs that require both disciplines.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">High-density board assembly</div><p>Fine-pitch placement, dense board layouts and in-line inspection and test for high-complexity PCBAs.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">In-house automation engineering</div><p>Hana's internal automation teams design and build production equipment for program-specific requirements.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Our scope</h2><p class="mk-body">Three principal areas of Hana manufacturing capability support AI data-center infrastructure: TEC control electronics and modules, high-density PCBA for optical test systems, and SiC power-conversion assembly.</p></div><div class="mk-spoke-main"><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Thermoelectric cooling (TEC) devices and electronics</span></div><div class="desc"><p>Thermoelectric cooling is a solid-state method of localized temperature control. A TEC can be positioned directly against the component or assembly being cooled and adjusted rapidly to maintain a defined operating temperature.</p><p>In data-center applications, TEC devices can be used alongside heatsinks and liquid-cooling systems in thermally sensitive areas such as GPU and HBM hotspots, optical transceivers, co-packaged optics and switch ASICs, where temperature stability affects performance or signal integrity.</p></div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">High-density PCBA for high-speed oscilloscopes</span></div><div class="desc"><p>Hana manufactures dense, multi-layer PCBAs used in high-speed oscilloscopes and optical test equipment for transceiver qualification. Fine-pitch SMT, controlled reflow and X-ray inspection are used where high component density and hidden joints require additional process control.</p></div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">SiC power conversion</span></div><div class="desc"><p>SiC-based power conversion is increasingly relevant to high-efficiency power-management architectures. Hana supports assembly processes used for SiC power devices, including die attachment to ceramic substrates, high-current interconnect and the associated drive electronics.</p><p>These processes draw on established automotive and industrial power-electronics manufacturing capabilities within the Hana group.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">TEC control-electronics PCBA, high-density PCBA &amp; module assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from AI-infrastructure engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for data centers?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana supports three areas of data-center electronics manufacturing: control electronics and integrated modules around thermoelectric cooling devices, high-density PCBAs for optical test equipment, and SiC power-conversion assemblies.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for high-speed oscilloscopes?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures high-density PCBAs used in high-speed oscilloscopes and optical test equipment for transceiver qualification. These boards are assembled using fine-pitch SMT, with X-ray inspection applied where hidden solder joints require it.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What is thermoelectric cooling (TEC) in an AI data center?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">TEC is a solid-state method of localized temperature control. In data-center hardware it can be used alongside heatsinks and liquid-cooling systems where precise temperature regulation is required close to the heat source.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Where does Hana manufacture this work?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Data-center electronics manufacturing is currently supported from Hana's Lamphun PCBA facility in Northern Thailand, including program-specific automation developed by the in-house engineering team.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana scale a new data-center program?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Programs can progress from qualification through low-volume manufacturing and into higher-volume production, with production equipment and line configuration developed around the program requirements.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an AI data-center program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us about your thermal-management, optical-test, high-density PCBA or power-conversion program. Our Thailand team can identify the appropriate manufacturing route and next steps.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>